2
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:54,000
Accused is a drama, thriller film directed by Philip Barantini.

3
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:18,000
After a revenge obsessed society incorrectly selects its next target, a young man must
survive the night as the online witch-hunt arrives at his front door.

4
